# Pairs with SplitOnlyOfNonEmptyLeaf. A split begins on a leaf that holds no
# rows.
MODULE: SplitOnlyOfNonEmptyLeafEmptySplit
TARGET: SplitOnlyOfNonEmptyLeaf
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an empty leaf is split
PERTURBS: SplitIntent

--- FIND
    /\ phase = "idle" /\ rowsD # {}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: no rows required.
    /\ phase = "idle"
--- END
